    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "kind": "utility_and_termination",
      "finding": "168/336 native task passes (50%). 314 loops finish with an answer; 20 hit the eight-call budget and two hit the denial budget. Zero Python error rows does not mean all tasks completed successfully."
